      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    daily_returns = [1.5, -0.5, 3.2, -2.0, 0.8]\n    n = len(daily_returns)\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the excess kurtosis\n    mean_return = sum(daily_returns) / n\n    m2 = sum((x - mean_return) ** 2 for x in daily_returns) / n\n    m4 = sum((x - mean_return) ** 4 for x in daily_returns) / n\n    excess_kurtosis = (m4 / (m2 ** 2)) - 3\n    answer = round(excess_kurtosis, 2)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
